SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260503T035608Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260503T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260503T120000
SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Sundays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nBec
 ause the early bird gets the tennis court! This time slot is a test-in-pro
 gress and feedback is highly encouraged! We can’t please everyone but ma
 ybe we can meet halfway and pass the torch along?\n\nAs we test this out\,
  maybe this can be a staggered arrival event. So those who prefer later st
 art-times can try and maintain momentum for the group and keep things goin
 g and courts reserved for those who are participating in-person with one a
 nother as through this group. If you are a serious attendee then please ke
 ep monitoring each event’s meetup app messages on your phone for updates
  for any one event you are seriously planning to attend.\n\nFor our early 
 morning group I would like to throw in some quick-rotation points games (5
 -7 points and then everyone on that court do a 1-person rotation clockwise
 ) maybe after some initial warm-up rallies if needed. There should be no f
 ormal teams (so we can fairly keep everything mixed) and everyone will ess
 entially have to play both against and with everyone who shows up on any g
 iven day and time slot.\n\nWe are typically beginners to intermediate. If 
 you are very good please go easier on less polished members while still tr
 ying to provide a bit of challenge for them. The goal should be for everyo
 ne to improve or maintain\, but only within keeping positive group energy.
  Because the ultimate goal of course should be to socialize and have fun. 
 And improving our game along the way is only the bonus!\n\nDISCLAIMER: Cou
 rts are subject to availability and weather. If you make serious plans to 
 attend then please be prepared to cancel or adjust our location as needed.
  Furthermore\, by attending you also agree to be fully responsible for you
 r own health and safety (e.g. you take breaks and hydrate at your own pers
 onal discretion\, even if it has to be\, for example\, in the middle of a 
 match). By attending you fully absolve anyone other than yourself for any 
 liability regarding your own personal health at these events regardless of
  time\, place\, and weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314560467/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260430T150153Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260430T150153Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
