SUMMARY:Van Vleck Spring Plant Sale NOW 10AM - 11:30 AM
DESCRIPTION:UPDATE: OUR SALE WILL END EARLIER ON SUNDAY – AT 11:30AM \nOur annual in-person plant sale is a fabulous community event every spring. Find the highest quality annuals\, perennials\, herbs\, vegetables\, hanging baskets and special items all chosen by our Van Vleck Horticulturalist. \nMembers will enjoy first access to our Spring Plant Sale items on Members’ Evening and a 10% discount on all purchases during the sale.  Not a member? Join or renew HERE. \nInterested in finding Native Plants at our sale? Check out this informative brochure about Native Plants prepared by our partners at Bee City and Northeast Earth Coalition. \nNative Plant Benefits brochure \nWe will be collecting nonperishable food for local food pantries. Please look for the marked donation bins at the check-out area.
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/van-vleck-spring-plant-sale-2-4/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Events,Children,Adults,Family
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2026/01/20250501_180306-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Montclairlocal": "https://montclairlocal.news/event/spring-plant-sale-at-van-vleck-gardens-4/2026-05-03/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:montclairlocal
X-SOURCE:Montclair Local News
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260503T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260503T160000
DTSTAMP:20260502T235403
CREATED:20260414T153008Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260414T153008Z
UID:10139714-1777802400-1777824000@montclairlocal.news
SUMMARY:Spring Plant Sale at Van Vleck Gardens
DESCRIPTION:Our annual in-person plant sale is a fabulous community event every spring. Find the highest quality annuals\, perennials\, herbs\, vegetables\, hanging baskets and special items all chosen by our Van Vleck Horticulturalist. Plant advisors will be on hand to help you make your best selection. Don’t forget Mother’s Day is right around the corner! \nMembers will enjoy first access to our Spring Plant Sale items on Members’ Evening and a 10% discount on all purchases during the sale. Join or renew on our website. \nInterested in finding Native Plants at our sale? See the helpful list prepared by our partners at Bee City and Northeast Earth Coalition posted on our website. \nIf you are looking for a fun way to volunteer at a nonprofit organization\, we would love to have your help. Contact Info@vanvleck.org. High school students can receive community service hours for helping at the sale. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/spring-plant-sale-at-van-vleck-gardens-4/2026-05-03/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Spring-Plant-Sale-2026_Facebook.png
END:VEVENT
