CREATED:20260408T182337Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260408T182337Z
UID:10139490-1777820400-1777820400@montclairlocal.news
SUMMARY:& Sons at Luna Stage
DESCRIPTION:Winner of the Kirk Prize for Best New Play\, & Sons by Jack Angelo Cummings is a sharply funny\, quietly devastating portrait of brotherhood\, labor\, and the ways men learn—often badly—to love one another. \nOn a New Jersey construction site\, the DiSanti crew eats subs\, burritos\, and pizza on their lunch break while everything underneath begins to crack. Dom\, the sweet-natured\, perpetually high second son\, is caught between his best friend Juan\, a driven protégé hungry to lead the company\, and his older brother Anthony\, a imposing\, tightly woundvfigure newly returned after years of unexplained absence. As power struggles escalate and old wounds resurface\, the men avoid saying what they feel—touching\, jostling\, and posturing instead\, using work and food as cover for grief\, loyalty\, and longing. By turns hilarious and aching\, & Sons is an intimate meditation on masculinity\, inheritance\, and how blue-collar men translate emotion into action when language fails. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/sons-at-luna-stage/2026-05-03/
LOCATION:Luna Stage Theatre Company\, 555 Valley Road\, West Orange\, NJ\, 07052\, United States
CATEGORIES:Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Sons.jpg
GEO:40.7691725;-74.2464479
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Luna Stage Theatre Company 555 Valley Road West Orange NJ 07052 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=555 Valley Road:geo:-74.2464479,40.7691725
END:VEVENT
