LAST-MODIFIED:20260420T203052Z
UID:10139745-1777923000-1777923000@montclairlocal.news
SUMMARY:Montclair Music Club : Young Artists Program
DESCRIPTION:Every May\, MMC shines a spotlight on the outstanding talent of our community’s young musicians. This special evening honors exceptional students of MMC teachers as well as other gifted young performers from the area. \nWe are thrilled to present an outstanding lineup this year: \n\nViolinist Gabriel Anker with pianist Mary Pinto performing works by Beethoven and Respighi\nCellist Nicolas Mirabile with pianist Rachel Choo performing Beethoven’s Cello Sonata No. 4\nSoprano Abby Brodnick with pianist Mary Pinto performing songs by Fauré and Poulenc\, joined by violinist Gabriel Anker for a Mozart aria.\nPianist Alice Tung performing Brahms Four Piano Pieces\nPianist Derek Zhang performing works by Granados\, Respighi\, and Debussy\n\nThese remarkable young artists have already earned numerous awards and won many competitions. We can’t wait for them to share their exceptional talent with our audience in what promises to be a memorable evening of beautiful music! \nThis concert is free and open to the public. Suggested donations are warmly appreciated to help cover MMC’s expenses for the season\, with special support for the Young Artists Program. \nMMC is a 501(c) (3) organization. You can donate at the registration desk or at the website: https://montclairmusicclub.org/donate/ \n Please enter the church by the double doors at the circular driveway. \nReception immediately following the program. \nFollow MMC at: \n www.montclairmusicclub.org \n Montclair Music Club – Home | Facebook \nhttps://YouTube.com/@MontclairMusicClub \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/montclair-music-club-young-artists-program/
LOCATION:The Presbyterian Church of Upper Montclair\, 53 Norwood Avenue\, Upper Montclair\, NJ\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Montclair-Music-Club-Flyer-May-4-2026-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Music Club":MAILTO:lpaparatto@gmail.com
GEO:40.8442101;-74.2021313
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Presbyterian Church of Upper Montclair 53 Norwood Avenue Upper Montclair NJ 07043 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=53 Norwood Avenue:geo:-74.2021313,40.8442101
END:VEVENT
