SUMMARY:(CANCELLED) Adult Dungeons & Dragons: Create Your Own Character NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nGet ready to begin your adventure!\n\nIn this hands-on class\, 
 students will learn how to design and develop their own unique character in 
 preparation for a Dungeons & Dragons campaign. Participants will explore 
 character sheets\, learn about different character classes\, and practice 
 writing engaging backstories that bring their heroes to life.\n\nThe course 
 will also introduce key game mechanics and discuss how party composition 
 helps a group work together during an adventure. By the end of the class\, 
 each student will have a fully developed character and the knowledge needed 
 to jump confidently into a D&D campaign. Along the way\, we’ll cover 
 character sheets\, backstory writing\, character classes\, party 
 composition\, game mechanics\, and more!
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Tower Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Games
UID:LibCal-10306-16491193
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16491193
