SUMMARY:Italian Conversation - Online
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nThis class is appropriate for those who have some basic 
 knowledge of Italian. Each class focuses on the use of Italian and cultural 
 knowledge for communicating in a variety of situations including shopping\, 
 sightseeing\, making reservations\, dining out and having a simple 
 conversation with others.  Students will speak using the present tense and 
 will be introduced to simple grammar to express past time.  We will review 
 many relevant expressions and vocabulary in context. This course will be 
 appropriate for students who have completed Italian for Travelers 1 and 2 
 or Basic Italian 1 & 2.\n
LOCATION:Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Language
