SUMMARY:Mixed Chair/Standing Exercises
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nIf you have difficulty doing exercises on the floor\, this is 
 the class for you. Learn movements while standing and sitting in a chair. 
 The result will be greater strength\, toning and flexibility\, and may help 
 to improve balance. Light weights or therabands are optional.\n
