SUMMARY:(CXLD) Introduction to iPhone Videography
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. \n\nUnlock the power of your 
 iPhone to create high-quality video content in this hands-on\, two-part 
 workshop designed for adult learners. In the first session\, you'll learn 
 practical tips and techniques for shooting professional-looking video using 
 just your phone—no fancy gear required. The second session will guide you 
 through the basics of editing and producing your footage\, helping you turn 
 raw clips into polished\, shareable media. Perfect for beginners and anyone 
 looking to tell their story through video!\n\nStudents must have an iPhone 
 to take this course. They must have ample storage space on their iPhones 
 for filming and must know their Google login information ahead of time.\n
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Computers & Technology
UID:LibCal-10306-16459231
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16459231
