SUMMARY:'Our Journeys' VBP Special Exhibit - Opening Event
DESCRIPTION:Join MPL for the kick-off of Our Journeys\, a traveling exhibit 
 presented by the Vietnamese Boat People with an opening reception\, free 
 and open to the public. Attendees must RSVP here.\n\nCelebrate AAPI 
 Heritage Month with Our Journeys\, a powerful multimedia exhibition created 
 by the Vietnamese Boat People nonprofit organization (VBP)\, on view from 
 May 6 to June 6 during library public hours.\n\nCentering the voices of 
 Vietnamese Americans\, Our Journeys brings to life deeply personal stories 
 of migration\, memory\, and resilience. Through oral histories\, cherished 
 artifacts\, and interactive elements\, the exhibition invites visitors to 
 explore the emotional and historical threads that connect generations 
 across the diaspora.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Adult Services, Lectures / History & Culture
UID:LibCal-10306-16607978
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16607978
END:VEVENT
