SUMMARY:Train Tales Storytime
DESCRIPTION:Our regular Thursday Raising Readers storytime is heading out 
 to the park! Please join us for Train Tales at the Judy Weston Garden for 
 stories and songs about trains. We'll also watch the train go by and enjoy 
 nature. Please bring a blanket to sit on. (If it is raining\, we will meet 
 at the library as usual.) \n\nThere is parking available on Midland Ave. 
 (cross street Watchung Ave.). Judy Weston Garden is in Watchung Park. \n\n
LOCATION:Montclair - Offsite
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Children's Programs, Storytime
UID:LibCal-10306-16765292
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16765292
END:VEVENT
