SUMMARY:Christian Singles Meet & Greet  -Online Zoom Event
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nMee
 t & Greet for Christian Singles\, ages 25-45. This is an online event.\n\n
 I asked Chat GPT some good questions to ask and we will be taking turns an
 swering them. We will go through as many questions as we can in the limite
 d time.\n\nChat GPT says:\n\n### 🌿 Faith & Relationship with God\n\n* W
 hen did you feel closest to God recently?\n* What’s something God has be
 en teaching you this season?\n* Is there a Bible verse that’s been on yo
 ur heart lately?\n* How do you handle doubt or spiritual dryness?\n\n### 
 💛 Identity & Purpose\n\n* Do you feel called to something specific righ
 t now?\n* How do you deal with comparison or insecurity?\n\n### 🤍 Frien
 dships & Community\n\n* What does a Godly friendship look like to you?\n* 
 How can we better support each other in our faith?\n* Have you ever had to
  set boundaries in a friendship? What was that like?\n* How do you handle 
 conflict in a Christ-like way?\n\n### 💍 Dating\, Love & Relationships\n
 \n* What qualities do you value most in a Godly relationship?\n* How do yo
 u guard your heart while dating?\n* What does “waiting on God” look li
 ke in relationships?\n* How do you balance faith and emotions in romantic 
 situations?\n\n### 🌸 Life Struggles & Growth\n\n* How do you respond wh
 en prayers feel unanswered?\n* What helps you stay grounded during hard ti
 mes?\n* How has a difficult season strengthened your faith?\n\n### 📖 Fu
 n but Meaningful\n\n* Which person in the Bible do you relate to most and 
 why?\n* If you could ask God one question right now\, what would it be?\n*
  What does your “dream life” look like if God is at the center?
