SUMMARY:Beginner Irish - Online
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nJoin us for a beginner's introduction to the Irish language! 
 This online class will cover spelling\, pronunciation\, common phrases and 
 vocabulary. Along the way\, you will learn Irish first and last names and 
 the original\, meaningful place names (Logainmneacha) of Ireland.\n\nSkip 
 Date: May 14\, 2026\n
