SUMMARY:V for Volleyball at Overpeck Park
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nI'm
  Mike and my son is Michael. Join us as we play for fun initially\, then w
 e'll break up into teams. When we make teams\, we'll get a bit competitive
  where you must serve to score! Games will be to 25 or 15 if we have more 
 people playing.\nOutdoor hard court. No kicking\, no using your head.\nWe 
 may be going to Tropical Juice Bar afterwards at 60 River St. in Hackensac
 k or somewhere for food/drinks.\nThere's no fee to play\, maybe bring a ba
 ll. We'll have 2 Mikasa balls & 1 Wilson ball.\nIt's not on 41 Willow Tree
  Road\, Leonia\, NJ.\nThe court is open to the public and if it happens to
  be taken\, we may play with those already playing it or we will move to t
 he grass since we have our own Volleyball NET!\nIf it's looking like it'll
  rain\, I'll make a call on whether to cancel.\nIf you have fun and would 
 like to play with us at other locations\, join us!\n[V for Volleyball New 
 Jersey | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/groups/1587314685975434)
