SUMMARY:John Ynsua Artist Reception in Gallery
DESCRIPTION:The Montclair Public Library is proud to present the artistic 
 stylings of John Ynsua on view in the library gallery at 50 South Fullerton 
 Avenue\, Montclair\, NJ 07042 from May 1 –May 29 during Library hours.  
 You will have the opportunity meet the artist at his art reception from 
 1-3pm on Saturday\, May 9.  \n\n\n\n“John Ynsua\, lifelong inhabitant of 
 New Jersey\, has despite the best efforts of formal art instruction 
 maintained a desire to produce art in a variety of forms. Comic books\, 
 vintage Science Fiction and Fantasy art\, remain his primary influences as 
 well as any and every style of art that catches his attention. Symbolism\, 
 pareidolia\, visual puns\, and dark whimsy are frequently employed to 
 insure that every viewer’s interpretation will differ.”  \n\n\n\n \n\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Cafe Area
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:
