SUMMARY:In-Person and Live Stream Service: Children's Spring Pageant
DESCRIPTION:Sunday worship takes place at 10am in person at 176 Cooper Avenue in Montclair or livestreamed on our YouTube channel:  Sunday Worship Livestream \nUnion Congregational Church is located in Montclair\, New Jersey\, at 176 Cooper Avenue (nearest major cross streets are Grove Street and Valley Road). There is street parking on Cooper Avenue. We have a small parking lot for seniors and those with limited mobility reached through a driveway to the left of the church. There are two accessible spots and a ramp on the left side of the building. Additional parking is available on neighboring streets. Please note that Cooper Avenue runs one way on Sundays\, so it is best to enter from Valley Road or Northview Avenue. \nEnter the church through the main Sanctuary doors under the tower or through the accessible entrance through the Assembly Room at the top of the ramp on the left side of the church. \nWatch Our Livestream Online By Clicking Here   \nClick here for the Sunday Worship Bulletin \n 
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/in-person-and-live-stream-service-3-2-8/
LOCATION:Sanctuary
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Christian Education,Featured Events
END:VEVENT
