 the month\, after worship\, in the FCC library. </span><span> </span><spa
 n><span><span>Our congregation is committed to the idea that creation car
 e is central to each aspect of our church: our theology and worship\, inst
 itutional life and practices\, and our partnership and work in the wider c
 ommunity. </span></span></span><span>Learn about FCC’s climate justice 
 initiatives\, be part of planning our events\, and live your faith by taki
 ng action for the planet. </span><br><span>Check out our Green Team Minis
