DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nDiscover how contemporary poems act as prompts to inspire your 
 own writing. Use imagery\, language and theme of the model poem as a 
 springboard to generate your own poetry. Share and discuss each other's 
 writing. All students welcome\; both new and experienced poets.\n\nPlease 
 note: the Bellevue Avenue Branch is NOT wheelchair accessible.\n
LOCATION:Montclair Bellevue Ave Branch - Classroom\, Montclair Bellevue Avenue Branch
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
