DTEND:20260512T183000Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T000000Z
SUMMARY:How to Retire to the Caribbean Through Investment Online NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nAre you dreaming of a morning smoothie on the pink sand 
 beaches of Bermuda or a leisurely afternoon snorkel session by the glorious 
 barrier reef near Belize? In this free talk\, Hoda Elamir\, an attorney who 
 specializes in advising clients on how to retire to the Caribbean through 
 investments\, the most popular method\, will explain the how it works and 
 answer questions. The class explores global mobility\, 
 citizenship-by-investment\, and retiring abroad. It examines how 
 individuals and families can leverage cross-border residency and 
 citizenship programs for asset protection\, tax optimization\, and 
 lifestyle planning.
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School
UID:LibCal-10306-16406946
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16406946
