DESCRIPTION:Spring Lantern Workshop for Families – FREE event \nPartner Program with the Judy Weston Garden \nSaturday\, May 16th\, 2:00 PM – 3:00 PM \nLocation: Van Vleck House & Gardens \nLantern maker and art teacher Jen Campbell will help families create decorated\, LED-lit vellum glow lanterns\, perfect for hanging out on a Spring evening! All who participate are invited to a Twilight Lantern Parade at the Judy Weston Garden in Watchung Park (weather permitting).  Designed for children ages 4 and up. All children must be accompanied by an adult. This class is sponsored by the Judy Weston Garden. \nThis program is free\, but registration is required –  no drop-ins \n \n 
