UID:TU1893137865
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20260521T190000
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20250605T175510Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Shavuot community celebration with Bnai
  Keshet\, Shomrei Emunah\, Temple Ner Tamid\, and Temple Sholom of West Es
 sex. Taking place this year at Temple Ner Tamid\, we will gather together 
 for a night of prayer\, study\, and Torah. In addition to our classes\, ta
 ught by local clergy and congregants\, we will be joined by scholar Moulie
  Vidas\, Associate Professor of Religion at Princeton University and the a
 uthor of numerous works on the Talmud including the National Book award fi
 nalist The Rise of Talmud.  \n  \n**Evening Schedule:**  \n7:00pm - Festiv
 al Service  \n7:30pm - Dairy Oneg  \n8:30pm - Keynote Address by Dr. Mouli
 e Vidas  \n9:40pm - Breakout Study Sessions 1  \n10:50pm - Breakout Study 
 Sessions 2   \n12:00am - Study Session with Dr. Moulie Vidas  \n12:45am - 
 Reading of the Ten Commandments  \n  \nRegistration_link: https://members.
 nertamid.org/form/tikkun-leil-shavuot.html\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260430T214955Z
LOCATION:Temple Ner Tamid\, 936 Broad St\, Bloomfield\, NJ 07003\, USA\, #
 #holiday:shavuot
TRANSP:OPAQUE
