SUMMARY:Yoga in the Garden
DESCRIPTION:Yoga in the Garden – In-person/Outdoor \nTuesday Evenings: May 19\, 26\, June 2\, 9\, 16\, 23 \n6:00 PM – 7:00 PM \nInstructor: Jennifer Hondru-Celestin \nSpend a peaceful evening practicing mindful slow-flow yoga. Jennifer takes inspiration from the magnificent natural beauty of the Van Vleck Gardens to lead a class blending mindful movement\, breath\, meditation\, and a good dose of humor and fun. Our yoga community welcomes all levels from beginner to experienced yogis. \nIn case of inclement weather\, the class will be canceled and participants will be notified. \nFee:   Single class: $20 Members / $25 General Public                                          \nRegistration is required on or before the Monday prior to each class.  There is no drop-in option for this class.  
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/yoga-in-the-garden-12/2026-05-26/
