DESCRIPTION:Register: <a href="https://tinyurl.com/UUCMGSEW">https://tiny
 url.com/UUCMGSEW</a><br><br>Join us as we examine America's Declaration of
  Independence in its 250th Anniversary Year! Using Walter Isaacson's "The 
 Greatest Sentence Ever Written" as a guide\, we will look with fresh eyes 
 at the Humanistic Vision undergirding our nation's highest ideals - concep
 ts that also formed the foundation of a robust Unitarian Universalism at i
 ts founding.<br><br>The book can be found here: <a href="https://www.amaz
 on.com/Greatest-Sentence-Ever-Written/dp/1982181311" target="_blank">https
 ://www.amazon.com/Greatest-Sentence-Ever-Written/dp/1982181311</a>\n\nJoin
  with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/ssu-nada-htz\nOr dial: (US) +1 
 252-656-5376 PIN: 590196736#\nMore phone numbers: https://tel.meet/ssu-nad
 a-htz?pin=9088208718108&hs=7\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.
 google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
