 ith a variety of polished\, brand-ready images. Your Final Deliverables 
 – Every participant will receive 3–5 professionally edited images plus
  behind-the-scenes content from your session\, perfect for social media. N
 etworking\, Light Bites & Refreshments – Stick around after your session
  to mingle with fellow professionals\, enjoy complimentary light bites and
  refreshments\, and make meaningful connections. A Goodie Bag – Because 
 you deserve a little something extra! Each attendee will leave with a cura
 t
